.env.local
.env*.local
node_modules/
.next/
firebase-service-account.json
firebase-service-account.json.bak

# Claude local settings (machine-specific)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Owner's personal / scratch files — see "Never commit the owner's personal
# files" in CLAUDE.md. Add a name here when one turns out to be permanent.
firebaseConfig
memory.md
PROMPT.md
promptHomeScreen.md
prompts/
instructions.md

# Documentation, internal notes and agent config — kept on disk, never
# published. This repo is public, so the launch runbook, the security notes and
# the iOS app's state are all deliberately local-only (owner's call, 2026-11-02).
#
# `*.md` is a blanket rule: every markdown file in the tree is ignored, at any
# depth. If you ever genuinely want one published (a real README, say), force it
# in with `git add -f README.md` — otherwise it will be silently skipped.
#
# `devNotes/` is listed as well as `*.md` because it also holds non-markdown
# files (`google-keys.pdf` and its generator) that the blanket rule misses.
*.md
devNotes/
.claude/
.agents/

# Expo dev logs (can contain env vars)
.expo/dev/logs/

# macOS / build artifacts — should never have been tracked
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
